Usage: hx4diva [command] [options] [flags]
    Commands
        build     : Compiles a folder containing source code and a valid mod project file into a mod.
            - [optional] path :  Path to the mod's project file. Defaults to mod.json if left undefined.
                           Ex : hx4diva build project.json

        create    : Creates a blank mod project.
            - [optional] name : Name of project. Set to "DummyMod" if left undefined.
                           Ex : hx4diva create "Testing Mod"

        setup     : Fully sets up Hx4Diva for use. Makes the "hx4diva" command directly accesible.
        help      : Info on all commands.

    Flags
        -verbose  : Gives more information/transparency on background processes of the command running.
                    (only available for 'build, create')

        -debug    : Compiles the mod project in debug mode.
                    (only available for 'build')

